            <ArticleTitle>Wounding, doubting, and trusting in suffering.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>159-66</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Constructs a working model of pastoral care on the foundation of the reality of suffering. Explicates how suffering wounds the person both psychologically and spiritually and how doubting God can be a constructive phase leading to the reclaiming of trust in God.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
